  "Notes": [
    {
      "Text": "Security update for apr-util",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for apr-util fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2025-49506: hash/password content leak via side channel timing attack against `apr_password_validate()`\n  (bsc#1274237).\n- CVE-2026-32327: XML stack recursion crash (bsc#1274235).\n- CVE-2026-34191: SQL injection via `apr_dbd_oracle` (bsc#1274850).\n- CVE-2026-34501: heap buffer overflow in redis client (bsc#1274852).\n- CVE-2026-34502: heap buffer overflow in APR memcached client (bsc#1274854).\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
